OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are data centres with gas
OL,4,Aplants being branded 'insane'?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the UK's dash for data centres shows
OL,7,Fno sign of slowing down, two
OL,8,Fcouncillors have highlighted a new
OL,9,Fconcern over the facilities ` on-site
OL,10,Fgas production.
OL,12,FProposals for two hyperscale data
OL,13,Fcentres in Bedfordshire and
OL,14,FBuckinghamshire have been branded
OL,15,F"insane" by Ed Gemmell, a councillor
OL,16,Ffor Buckinghamshire Council, as they
OL,17,Finclude gas power stations.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
PN,37102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1790227610
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are data centres with gas
OL,4,Aplants being branded 'insane'?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has designated data
OL,7,Fcentres as "critical infrastructure"
OL,8,Fand said claims they were "draining the
OL,9,Fcountry's water or blowing carbon
OL,10,Ftargets" were false.
OL,12,F"I'm not AI [artificial intelligence]
OL,13,Faverse, but saying we can't get enough
OL,14,Felectricity so we need a gas power
OL,15,Fstation is a really terrible idea,"
OL,16,Fsaid Susan Clinch, a Central
OL,17,FBedfordshire councillor.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
